    {
      "id": "txt034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 326.74,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 269246,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3560786,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "and 118 more, none of which run",
      "originalText": "and 118 more, none of which run",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 463.76,
      "height": 127.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 277165,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3665515,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "next is followed whatever the gate said.\nsub is only followed when the gate said yes.\n\nSo a container with a gate is a switch for\neverything hanging off it, and the four\nboxes on the left of it still run at -O0.",
      "originalText": "next is followed whatever the gate said.\nsub is only followed when the gate said yes.\n\nSo a container with a gate is a switch for\neverything hanging off it, and the four\nboxes on the left of it still run at -O0.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt036",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 463.76,
      "height": 170.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 285084,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3770244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The gate on all_optimizations is one line:\n\n    return optimize >= 1 && !optimize_debug;\n\nThat line is the whole of what -O0 means to\nthe middle end. There is no list of things\n-O0 skips kept anywhere, because there does\nnot need to be one.",
      "originalText": "The gate on all_optimizations is one line:\n\n    return optimize >= 1 && !optimize_debug;\n\nThat line is the whole of what -O0 means to\nthe middle end. There is no list of things\n-O0 skips kept anywhere, because there does\nnot need to be one.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt037",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 885.36,
      "height": 127.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 293003,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3874973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What the listing does not show.\n\n-fdump-passes asks every pass its own gate and prints the answer, so a pass inside a\nclosed container prints ON and never runs. At -O2 that is 60 of the 281 that printed\nON, and none of them wrote a dump. The listing is a map of what each pass would say\nif asked right now. It is not a record of what ran.",
      "originalText": "What the listing does not show.\n\n-fdump-passes asks every pass its own gate and prints the answer, so a pass inside a\nclosed container prints ON and never runs. At -O2 that is 60 of the 281 that printed\nON, and none of them wrote a dump. The listing is a map of what each pass would say\nif asked right now. It is not a record of what ran.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
